items.Arrakis_Blood_Extractor.name = Blood Extractor
items.Arrakis_Blood_Extractor.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and hold the right mouse button to hold it out in front of you.
items.Arrakis_Dew_Reaper.name = Dew Reaper
items.Arrakis_Dew_Reaper.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and click the right mouse button for a slow swing. Needs the Water of Arrakis mod and 100 power. Swung at a Primrose it collects 50 water; swung anywhere else it collects 1. The water goes into a Litrejon you carry (never into you); with no Litrejon that has room it is lost.
items.Arrakis_Compactor.name = Compactor
items.Arrakis_Compactor.description = An off-hand tool. Place it in a utility slot, pick it with Z, and hold the right mouse button to point it where you look. Aimed at sand within 3 blocks it compacts it: the block cracks, then gives one drop and heals, again and again, and is never broken. It costs 10 Arrakis power per second.
commands.arrakis.desc = Debug commands for the equipment of Arrakis: arrakis power fill|set <n> [player] (operators only)
commands.arrakis.power.desc = Debug commands for the Arrakis_Power stat: arrakis power fill|set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.power.fill.desc = Fill power to its maximum: arrakis power fill [player]
commands.arrakis.power.set.desc = Set power (0-100): arrakis power set <n> [player]
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray.name = Cutter Ray
items.Arrakis_Cutter_Ray.description = A two-handed pulse rifle. Hold the left mouse button to fire at a block up to 5 blocks away: each shot chips the block and throws sparks and white globs. Costs 10 power per shot. Does not hurt creatures.
commands.arrakis.compactor.desc = Compactor development commands.
commands.arrakis.compactor.selftest.desc = Runs the Compactor engine calls on a sand block placed at 0, 200, 0 and reports.
commands.arrakis.hud.desc = On-screen display commands (operators): arrakis hud tune | rig
commands.arrakis.hud.tune.desc = List the display settings, or set one live (not saved): arrakis hud tune [name value]
commands.arrakis.hud.rig.desc = Show the tool panel for 5 seconds (arrakis hud rig [tool]) or a test AMMO number (arrakis hud rig ammo <n>)
dewReaper.needsWaterMod = The Dew Reaper needs the Water of Arrakis mod.
dewReaper.needsPower = The Dew Reaper needs {cost} power.
commands.arrakis.dewreaper.desc = Dew Reaper development commands.
commands.arrakis.dewreaper.selftest.desc = Says whether Water of Arrakis is linked and runs its flask functions on a made-up Litrejon.
dewReaper.filledFlask = {added} water collected into a Litrejon ({amount}/{capacity}).
dewReaper.lost = {lost} water lost, no container.
items.Arrakis_Holtzman_Shield.name = Holtzman Shield
items.Arrakis_Holtzman_Shield.description = An off-hand utility. Place it in a utility slot and pick it with Z: while it is selected and you have power, an amber field surrounds you and projectile damage is taken out of your Arrakis power instead of your health. A hit that uses up the last of the power breaks the field and puts the shield away. It does nothing against melee, fire or falls.
commands.arrakis.shield.desc = Holtzman Shield test commands: arrakis shield hit <damage> | state
commands.arrakis.shield.hit.desc = Hit yourself with a projectile-sourced damage event of that size, through the normal damage path: arrakis shield hit <damage>
commands.arrakis.shield.state.desc = Say whether the Holtzman field is up, the power, and the effect state: arrakis shield state
items.Arrakis_Maula_Pistol.name = Maula Pistol
items.Arrakis_Maula_Pistol.description = A spring-gun pistol that fires darts. Hold it in your main hand: left click fires one dart (click again for the next, about three a second at most). Each shot costs 1 ammo, and a dart does 1 damage out to 40 blocks. Right click bashes. It cannot go in the off-hand slot.
items.Arrakis_Dartgun.name = Dartgun
items.Arrakis_Dartgun.description = A two-handed spring gun that fires darts. Left click fires one dart (click again for the next, about three a second at most). Each shot costs 1 ammo, and a dart does 1 damage out to 40 blocks. Right click bashes.
commands.arrakis.ammo.desc = Debug commands for the Arrakis_Ammo stat: arrakis ammo fill|set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.ammo.fill.desc = Fill ammo to its maximum: arrakis ammo fill [player]
commands.arrakis.ammo.set.desc = Set ammo (0-100): arrakis ammo set <n> [player]
commands.arrakis.dart.desc = Spring gun development commands.
commands.arrakis.dart.selftest.desc = Flies real darts around 0, 200, 0 and reports damage by distance, drop, range and the entity count.
